// This gadget is used for computing discharged signatures from
// the step queue generated by discharge_adv.rs.
// Main workflow: 
// (1) check the step queue of the subsigs, an empty step implies
//     subsig discharged (for most sub-sigs). Details to handle
//     on subsigs-groups, counter constraints etc. Need to apply
//     tri-logic rules on different kinds of subsigs.
// (2) Given the evaluation order (dnf) in advice, retrieve subsig
//     tri-logic values and compute their composition. Which is
//     the tri-logic value of the discharge state of subsig. 
//     Only those with a definite "no" are labled as discharged.
//     -> output is the list of discharged sigs.

